# This folder is a static page, not part of the Laravel application it sits
# inside. This host reads .htaccess from directories above the document root,
# and the project root's file rewrites every request into public/ — from here
# that is a loop, and a loop is the 500 that was being served for every path,
# including files that do not exist.
#
# Switching the engine off stops that inheritance. Nothing here needs rewriting.
RewriteEngine Off
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html
